---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Pest Control Victoria TX" description="Privacy policy for Pest Control Victoria TX.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Privacy Policy</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Last updated: October 2025</p>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you contact us by phone or through this website, we may collect your name, phone number, email address, service address and details about your pest concern so we can respond and provide service.</p>
      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you provide to schedule and perform pest control services, communicate with you about appointments, and improve our service. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
      <h2>Third Parties</h2>
      <p>We may use service providers (such as phone systems or website hosting) that process data on our behalf. This site is hosted for fast delivery and does not use invasive tracking beyond standard analytics if enabled.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: call (361) 555-0199 or write to 2301 E Mockingbird Ln, Victoria, TX 77904.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
